INTERNAL ENV PREFIX
-------------------
This engine's configuration variables use the internal prefix `ADJUTANT_`
(e.g. ADJUTANT_STATE, ADJUTANT_ENGINE). This is the engine's historical
internal name and is unrelated to the product brand. A brand-neutral rename is
planned for a future release; the prefix is documented in .env.example.
